  (11235, 'Feierabend', 'end of the working day, time off', 'noun', 'der', 'Feierabende', 'A2', 541, 'work', 'Um fünf habe ich Feierabend.', 'I finish work at five.', 'Register: spoken. Schönen Feierabend! = Enjoy your evening (said when leaving work).'),
