  (11242, 'WLAN', 'Wi-Fi', 'noun', 'das', 'WLANs', 'A2', 547, 'work', 'Wie ist das WLAN-Passwort?', 'What''s the Wi-Fi password?', 'Pronounced Weh-Lan.'),
