  (11701, 'Kraft', 'strength, power, force', 'noun', 'die', 'Kräfte', 'B1', 208, 'everyday', 'Ich habe keine Kraft mehr.', 'I''ve got no energy left.', 'in Kraft treten = to come into force.'),
