  (11349, 'jedoch', 'however', 'adverb', null, null, 'B1', 600, 'communication', 'Der Termin ist jedoch schon vergeben.', 'However, the appointment has already been taken.', 'Register: written. Mainly written. Mainly to understand when reading or listening.'),
